n      - name: Poisson approximation of the binomial\\n      - name: Infinitesimal definition\\n      - name: Inter-arrival times\\n      - name: Non-homogeneous Poisson processes\\n      - name: One-event Poisson process\\n      - name: Time change\\n\\n---\",\"totalLinesInFile\":380}","status":"completed"}},{"bubbleId":"23c3499d-6649-49b2-9ff9-415962d627b1","type":2,"text":"","capabilityType":15,"unifiedMode":2,"toolFormerData":{"tool":42,"name":"glob_file_search","rawArgs":"{\"targetDirectory\":\"/Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/dhruvdcoder.github.io\",\"globPattern\":\"**/_config*.yml\"}","params":"{\"targetDirectory\":\"/Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/dhruvdcoder.github.io\",\"globPattern\":\"**/_config*.yml\"}","result":"{\"directories\":[{\"absPath\":\"/Users/dhruveshpatel/Files/dhruvdcoder.github.io\",\"files\":[{\"relPath\":\"_config.yml\"}],\"totalFiles\":1}]}","status":"completed"}},{"bubbleId":"353e8e03-36c9-4d54-9d0a-b80a5cf2237c","type":2,"text":"","thinking":{"text":"This is a Jekyll or al-folio site. Draft posts belong in the `_drafts/` folder."},"capabilityType":30,"unifiedMode":2},{"bubbleId":"e58d1039-da30-4eb7-8259-c5b49b9fd08f","type":2,"text":"Move the post into `_drafts/` instead of `_posts/`.\n\nThis site already uses that pattern (e.g. `_drafts/2023-12-25-dynamic-decoding.md`). Jekyll skips `_drafts/` on a normal build/deploy, so the post won’t go live.\n\n**To draft an existing post**\n\n1. Move it from `_posts/` → `_drafts/`\n2. You can keep or drop the date prefix; drafts don’t need a publish date until you ship them\n\nExample for your CTMC post:\n\n```bash\nmv _posts/2026-05-10-ctmc.md _drafts/2026-05-10-ctmc.md\n```\n\n**To preview drafts locally**\n\n```bash\nbundle exec jekyll serve --drafts\n```\n\n**To publish later**\n\nMove the file back to `_posts/` with a `YYYY-MM-DD-slug.md` name (and set `date` in the front matter if you use it).","unifiedMode":2}],"fullConversationHeadersOnly":[{"bubbleId":"ae23e961-7c88-4921-b974-e9b2900ef983","type":